From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Barry Quokka <354230574+BarryQuokka@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 20:30:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: x126100-lenovo-thinkcentre-neo-50q-qc: Run
 the rear USB 2.0 port without a repeater

The first USB controller (usb_1_ss0, Windows' URS0) drives one port, the
rear USB-A port second from the right; the other five ports are on the
multiport controller. The IdeaCentre Mini x dtsi routes this controller's
eUSB2 PHY through the eUSB2 repeater of an SMB2360 at SPMI SID 7, which
this machine doesn't have:

  spmi spmi-1: pmic_arb_check_chnl_status_v1: 0x7 0x104: transaction failed (0x3) reg: 0x7008
  pmic-spmi 1-07: probe with driver pmic-spmi failed with error -5
  fd3000.phy  platform: wait for supplier .../spmi@c432000/pmic@7/phy@fd00
  a600000.usb platform: supplier fd3000.phy not ready

So the PHY and the controller stay deferred, the port is dead, and the
GCC's and interconnects' sync_state() stay pending on a600000.usb. The
DSDT lists no repeater for URS0 (USB3's two PTN3222s are its only
ones), and the eUSB2 PHY's repeater is optional.

Turn off the SMB2360 and drop the PHY's repeater. The controller probes
and a keyboard in that port works:

  xhci-hcd xhci-hcd.1.auto: irq 135, io mem 0x0a600000
  input: Lenovo Lenovo Calliope USB Keyboard Gen3 as /devices/platform/soc@0/a600000.usb/xhci-hcd.1.auto/usb1/1-1/...

with nothing left in devices_deferred.

Tested on a ThinkCentre neo 50q QC (13C8) with the Omarchy edge ISO
2026.11.18.495 (linux-omarchy 7.3.0-72), its embedded tree edited the
same way (pmic@7 off, the PHY's phys property renamed away).

Signed-off-by: Barry Quokka <354230574+BarryQuokka@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 .../dts/qcom/x126100-lenovo-thinkcentre-neo-50q-qc.dts |  8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x126100-lenovo-thinkcentre-neo-50q-qc.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x126100-lenovo-thinkcentre-neo-50q-qc.dts
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x126100-lenovo-thinkcentre-neo-50q-qc.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x126100-lenovo-thinkcentre-neo-50q-qc.dts
@@ -175,6 +175,10 @@
 	status = "okay";
 };
 
+&smb2360_0 {
+	status = "disabled";
+};
+
 &tlmm {
 	usb0_dp_hot_plug_detect: usb0-dp-hot-plug-detect-state {
 		pins = "gpio122";
@@ -212,6 +216,10 @@
 	qcom,select-utmi-as-pipe-clk;
 };
 
+&usb_1_ss0_hsphy {
+	/delete-property/ phys;
+};
+
 &usb_1_ss0_qmpphy {
 	/delete-property/ mode-switch;
 	/delete-property/ orientation-switch;
-- 
